## Notes
This environment does not currently expose a valid Azure subscription ID, so region and SKU selection has been left in a deployment-ready placeholder state. Once a real subscription is available, the values in `infra/main.bicep` and `infra/main.parameters.json` should be adjusted and deployed with Azure CLI.
